WEBVTT

00:00:03.635 --> 00:00:05.917
Aboard the ship heading to England,

00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:10.582
...Candy met a young man who reminded her
of late Anthony.

00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:14.602
That young man, who turned out to be a
son of an eminent nobleman,

00:00:14.637 --> 00:00:20.492
...arrived to London and unexpectedly
appeared before Candy.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:29.162
And so, Candy went through the gates
of the strictest school in England; St. Paul Academy.

00:00:30.311 --> 00:00:35.561
Pony's hill in prison.

00:00:39.604 --> 00:00:41.844
I'm Candice White Adley.

00:00:42.957 --> 00:00:46.963
Welcome. I'm the school director;
sister Gray.

00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:50.785
I'm sister Margaret.
Now, come here.

00:00:51.402 --> 00:00:52.219
Yes.

00:00:56.187 --> 00:00:58.878
Miss Adley, take off that fur.

00:00:58.882 --> 00:01:03.046
Uh, no, I've caught a cold during
the trip to England.

00:01:03.419 --> 00:01:07.192
Compared to America, this place
is much colder! And...

00:01:07.227 --> 00:01:09.249
Adley, I have a question for you.

00:01:10.171 --> 00:01:11.443
Y... Yes.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:15.475
What did you come here for?

00:01:15.476 --> 00:01:19.069
Of course... to study.. and to
become a prominent lady.

00:01:19.636 --> 00:01:23.321
And yet, you did not come here
as soon as your ship landed ashore.

00:01:23.815 --> 00:01:27.083
Instead, you went on a carefree
sightseeing tour of London.

00:01:27.468 --> 00:01:28.818
I'm sorry.

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:37.695
Do you understand? Once you become a student of
St. Paul academy, you are to obey my orders.

00:01:38.149 --> 00:01:39.585
Sister Margaret!

00:01:40.883 --> 00:01:42.132
-Now.
-No...

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:43.811
I'll take it off myself.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.989
The school will store it for you.

00:01:48.163 --> 00:01:49.332
No need to!

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:53.540
You have no need for such a gaudy
fur collar while studying.

00:01:53.575 --> 00:01:54.405
Hand it over!

00:01:56.058 --> 00:02:03.669
While you're on the premises, you must
obey director's and guard's orders.

00:02:05.565 --> 00:02:06.917
Adley!

00:02:07.374 --> 00:02:08.630
Hand it over!

00:02:10.731 --> 00:02:11.938
God...

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:17.487
Now.

00:02:20.972 --> 00:02:22.437
It's heavy.

00:02:22.864 --> 00:02:26.817
They're popular in America right now...
...because they're so warm and...

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.782
What's the matter?

00:02:32.336 --> 00:02:33.416
Kurin!

00:02:34.647 --> 00:02:37.178
Kurin, quickly, hide somewhere!

00:02:37.663 --> 00:02:42.506
Director!
Are you okay?

00:02:42.853 --> 00:02:44.543
What did you do just now?

00:02:45.135 --> 00:02:48.836
You brought a wild animal
onto the school premises!

00:02:49.036 --> 00:02:53.255
Uh, he's completely tame... and
he's been with me for...

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:57.053
Enough of that!
This is not a zoo!

00:02:57.739 --> 00:03:02.082
Sister Margaret. Immediately
catch that animal.

00:03:02.464 --> 00:03:04.033
Yes, director!

00:03:05.987 --> 00:03:08.167
-I'll help her!
-Wait.

00:03:09.738 --> 00:03:11.522
You will stay here.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:18.154
It's obvious that I need to explain
the school's teaching methods to you.

00:03:22.976 --> 00:03:25.572
Brother, will Candy be okay?

00:03:25.913 --> 00:03:28.675
Kurin is the problem.
I hope he didn't go crazy.

00:03:29.263 --> 00:03:30.935
There! It went that way!

00:03:31.961 --> 00:03:34.998
Hey, is something going on?

00:03:35.437 --> 00:03:37.660
There is a raccoon on the
school premises.

00:03:37.695 --> 00:03:40.879
Aren't wild raccoons extinct in England?

00:03:43.952 --> 00:03:46.814
Brother, it seems they saw through the play.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:51.405
I'd go over to help her, but we aren't
supposed to go anywhere near girls' ward.

00:03:52.369 --> 00:03:58.193
-So you're saying that you couldn't find it?
-Yes. It probably hid in the forest.

00:03:58.598 --> 00:04:03.870
Therefore, the staff and the students probably
don't have to worry about being attacked, right?

00:04:04.272 --> 00:04:06.743
Kurin would never attack a human!

00:04:07.491 --> 00:04:09.061
Be quiet!

00:04:10.035 --> 00:04:13.952
Sister Margaret, show Candice White
the way to her room.

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:15.059
As you wish.

00:04:16.841 --> 00:04:17.575
Let's go.

00:04:26.498 --> 00:04:29.657
Where is Kurin hiding?

00:04:36.886 --> 00:04:37.900
What are you doing?

00:04:37.935 --> 00:04:41.621
Uh, I thought, what a wonderful
school building.

00:04:41.656 --> 00:04:45.094
Candice White; speaking in the
corridors is forbidden.

00:04:45.129 --> 00:04:45.998
Yes!

00:04:49.094 --> 00:04:50.917
This is your room.

00:05:00.728 --> 00:05:03.247
Immediately start preparing
for tommorrow's lecture.

00:05:03.282 --> 00:05:06.646
We've gathered all the books
you'll be studying from. Understood?

00:05:10.494 --> 00:05:13.761
My head is hurting
after just looking at them!

00:05:14.764 --> 00:05:17.211
Just prayers and lectures...

00:05:19.668 --> 00:05:21.470
But it seems like this is a good place.

00:05:22.826 --> 00:05:24.658
That's right, I'd better look for Kurin!

00:05:28.926 --> 00:05:33.245
Kurin? Kurin, where are you?

00:05:36.701 --> 00:05:38.238
Maybe it's Kurin!

00:05:40.513 --> 00:05:44.739
How do you do?
My name is Patricia O'Brien.

00:05:44.904 --> 00:05:49.013
If you'd like, you can call me Patty.
I'm next.

00:05:49.219 --> 00:05:50.309
Next?

00:05:51.044 --> 00:05:54.917
Oh, you're in the next room.
I'm Candice White.

00:05:54.918 --> 00:05:56.599
But everyone calls me Candy.

00:05:57.553 --> 00:05:58.563
Well, come in!

00:05:58.714 --> 00:06:01.937
Excuse me for my intrusion.

00:06:03.376 --> 00:06:05.781
You're sounding so formal...

00:06:06.307 --> 00:06:08.994
Well, Candy?
How do you like your room?

00:06:09.136 --> 00:06:10.871
-Hey, Patty!
-Yes?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.172
You know raccoons, right?

00:06:13.383 --> 00:06:18.365
I know. These animals are related
to pandas, and are native to Americas.

00:06:18.815 --> 00:06:20.510
You sound like an encyclopedia!

00:06:21.262 --> 00:06:23.536
So, what about raccoons?

00:06:23.987 --> 00:06:26.141
Maybe you saw one.

00:06:26.317 --> 00:06:28.520
Yes, I did.

00:06:28.942 --> 00:06:30.325
Where?

00:06:30.549 --> 00:06:32.712
-In the books.
-Books?

00:06:33.099 --> 00:06:36.110
In an encyclopedia about animals
of the world!

00:06:36.518 --> 00:06:37.773
Come on...

00:06:39.396 --> 00:06:43.360
I saw a real one in a zoo when I
was a little girl.

00:06:44.164 --> 00:06:45.330
Alright...

00:06:45.743 --> 00:06:48.727
That's right! Maybe he
went to Archie's place!

00:06:49.696 --> 00:06:51.568
-Say, Patty...
-Huh?

00:06:51.774 --> 00:06:53.672
Where is boys' ward?

00:06:54.248 --> 00:06:56.437
Just what did you say?

00:06:56.605 --> 00:06:59.913
Boys' ward! Let's go over there!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.193
What?!

00:07:03.566 --> 00:07:05.643
Patty, why are you so startled?

00:07:05.829 --> 00:07:08.742
Girls going over to boys' ward...

00:07:08.939 --> 00:07:12.913
Come on, there is someone who is
almost a family to me in boys' ward!

00:07:12.914 --> 00:07:16.101
They are great people!
I'll introduce them to you.

00:07:16.133 --> 00:07:20.094
N..no, I'm fine. I'll concentrate
on my studies for now...

00:07:20.129 --> 00:07:23.684
You don't have to get involved...
Anyway, where is boys' ward...

00:07:23.951 --> 00:07:26.872
Ssssh! Your voice is too loud!

00:07:26.907 --> 00:07:30.342
You have to stop speaking like that.
It's a nuisance to others.

00:07:30.734 --> 00:07:32.513
What, only because of that?

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.661
This bell signals free time.

00:07:37.753 --> 00:07:38.905
Free time?

00:07:39.548 --> 00:07:43.164
Let's go. We're not supposed to be
in our rooms during our free time.

00:07:43.345 --> 00:07:47.564
-Huh? It's not really free time then!
-It's okay, just come.

00:07:53.434 --> 00:07:57.365
-This is the library.
-I already have enough books in my room...

00:08:02.991 --> 00:08:05.244
Maybe Kurin went to hide in here.

00:08:06.056 --> 00:08:07.116
Kurin...!

00:08:07.986 --> 00:08:09.939
What's the matter?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.668
-Uh... I'm just looking for something.
-Candy!

00:08:15.232 --> 00:08:16.746
Let's go.

00:08:21.524 --> 00:08:23.335
This is the lounge.

00:08:23.539 --> 00:08:25.956
A lounge is a place where one can speak, right?

00:08:32.122 --> 00:08:34.868
Nothing is going on... everyone
looks as though they're dead!

00:08:35.047 --> 00:08:38.700
Ssshh! It's a speaking room,
but you mustn't speak in a loud voice!

00:08:39.146 --> 00:08:40.667
Speaking room?

00:08:40.702 --> 00:08:43.032
Otherwise, you could bother others!

00:08:43.664 --> 00:08:46.905
They look as if they're telling
secrets to each other...

00:08:50.473 --> 00:08:54.860
Huh? Candy?
What a pleasant surprise.

00:08:55.388 --> 00:08:56.542
Hello.

00:08:56.621 --> 00:08:58.789
So Eliza is your friend!

00:08:58.898 --> 00:09:00.909
Yeah, I sort of know her.

00:09:01.483 --> 00:09:04.005
Candy, allow me to introduce
you to everyone.

00:09:04.446 --> 00:09:05.714
Eliza...

00:09:06.925 --> 00:09:09.409
This is Candice White from America.

00:09:09.576 --> 00:09:11.840
She is better known as the barn princess.

00:09:12.267 --> 00:09:13.595
Eliza...!

00:09:13.817 --> 00:09:15.252
Barn...?

00:09:16.082 --> 00:09:19.398
Even though it turned out that she
is now a member of the Adley family,

00:09:19.433 --> 00:09:22.178
...when she first arrived, she
worked as a dogsbody in our stables!

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:23.981
It's true, Candy!

00:09:26.771 --> 00:09:29.828
-She was a dogsbody...?
-Why is she here then?

00:09:32.669 --> 00:09:33.632
That's right!

00:09:33.667 --> 00:09:37.759
Oh, and won't you tell them how
your parents dumped you at the orphanage?

00:09:38.985 --> 00:09:41.084
Moreover, you're a murderer!

00:09:41.551 --> 00:09:43.197
Murderer?

00:09:45.622 --> 00:09:47.915
It was you who killed Anthony!

00:09:48.194 --> 00:09:50.346
Eliza, what are you saying?

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:54.200
If it weren't for you, that thing
would never have happened to Anthony!

00:10:02.976 --> 00:10:06.039
Eliza... do you really believe in that?

00:10:06.178 --> 00:10:07.066
Of course!

00:10:07.289 --> 00:10:10.618
Now, let's go, Patty!
You don't want to have anything with her!

00:10:31.927 --> 00:10:34.736
There was a bit of a word play in this
episode that didn't really translate well
into English.
When Patty first introduces herself to Candy,
she says that she's from the neighboring
room. This completely confuses Candy.
In Japanese language, the same words Patty
used could both mean "I'm from the next room"
and "I have gonorrhea".

00:10:43.013 --> 00:10:47.995
Who'd think that I would find
Eliza in this school...

00:10:48.984 --> 00:10:51.010
And Kurin went away somewhere.

00:10:52.597 --> 00:10:54.177
Yeah, who's that?

00:10:56.301 --> 00:10:59.000
Patty!
Come in!

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:00.959
No, I'll stay here.

00:11:01.782 --> 00:11:03.379
Can I help you somehow?

00:11:03.778 --> 00:11:10.338
Sister said that we will be wearing
white skirts for the morning prayer.

00:11:10.734 --> 00:11:12.172
White skirt?

00:11:12.699 --> 00:11:15.004
That's all. Good night.

00:11:16.114 --> 00:11:17.419
Good night.

00:11:18.208 --> 00:11:20.702
White skirt for the morning prayer...

00:11:30.516 --> 00:11:31.231
Teacher!

00:11:31.266 --> 00:11:34.673
Candice, you can't do this.
Your window is open.

00:11:35.675 --> 00:11:37.632
Close it and go to sleep.

00:11:40.038 --> 00:11:41.361
Curtains, too.

00:11:41.475 --> 00:11:43.591
I understand, sister Margaret.

00:11:44.705 --> 00:11:47.652
I left this opened because Kurin might
have entered during the night but...

00:11:47.687 --> 00:11:50.563
Moreover, how did they know about this?

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:56.483
Of course. They're much stricter
than I thought.

00:12:08.738 --> 00:12:10.335
I completely overslept!

00:12:12.414 --> 00:12:16.477
Patty! Patty!
Everybody is in the chapel already.

00:12:27.325 --> 00:12:29.282
Everybody is wearing black clothes.

00:12:30.299 --> 00:12:35.125
Sister said that we will be wearing
white skirts for the morning prayer.

00:12:44.163 --> 00:12:49.853
-What's with that outfit?
-Maybe she's on her way to the stables!

00:12:50.195 --> 00:12:53.820
-Patty!
-Candy, I'm sorry.

00:12:54.042 --> 00:12:55.409
Candy!

00:12:56.388 --> 00:12:58.714
What's the matter, standing out like that?

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:01.952
White looks good... but today,
black is better after all.

00:13:01.953 --> 00:13:03.503
I'm going to change!

00:13:05.657 --> 00:13:06.575
Director!

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:11.204
Candice White. Are you aware that black
outfit is required for the morning prayer?

00:13:12.221 --> 00:13:15.151
Yes... I'm sorry.
I got it wrong.

00:13:15.905 --> 00:13:17.519
But I can change quickly!

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:20.343
There's no time.
Take a seat.

00:13:21.236 --> 00:13:22.325
Yes.

00:13:29.117 --> 00:13:33.591
He's your God, he loves you,
he will forgive your sins...

00:13:46.372 --> 00:13:48.995
Terrius G. Grandchester!

00:13:51.439 --> 00:13:53.830
If you're late, it would be better
to stay out.

00:13:54.268 --> 00:13:56.339
Anyway, sit down.

00:13:58.634 --> 00:14:00.303
What's so funny?

00:14:00.616 --> 00:14:01.815
Nothing really.

00:14:02.013 --> 00:14:04.889
It's just that when I see everyone
praying like this...

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.576
They look so calm and polite on the surface,

00:14:09.611 --> 00:14:12.606
...but deep inside, I wonder
what are they really thinking about!

00:14:12.641 --> 00:14:14.221
Terrius, ge - -

00:14:14.222 --> 00:14:15.801
Was it "Get out"?

00:14:15.803 --> 00:14:18.518
Yeah, alright, you don't have to say it.
I can do that myself.

00:14:20.011 --> 00:14:23.127
I didn't come here to pray, however.

00:14:23.263 --> 00:14:26.519
-What did you come for, then?
-To take a nap.

00:14:29.956 --> 00:14:32.618
-God...
-Forgive him.

00:14:32.842 --> 00:14:36.802
This place is usually so quiet.
Unfortunately, that's not the case now.

00:14:37.535 --> 00:14:40.514
Hey, you're gonna tell me when
everyone leaves, okay?

00:14:41.271 --> 00:14:44.008
Well then, my earnest ladies and gentlemen!
Nice meeting you.

00:14:45.869 --> 00:14:47.915
Wait!

00:14:48.096 --> 00:14:52.013
Oh, I know. I am to come to
your office after this?

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.088
If that's what you want, I can keep you company.
Well then.

00:14:56.076 --> 00:14:58.517
Lord have mercy on him!

00:15:08.696 --> 00:15:11.177
Say, who was he?

00:15:11.615 --> 00:15:15.339
He's a son of Duke Grandchester,
Terrius G. Grandchester.

00:15:15.931 --> 00:15:17.624
He's a nobleman?

00:15:20.503 --> 00:15:22.594
Terrius G. Grandchester.

00:15:23.234 --> 00:15:26.483
It seems that he came here
just to upset the teachers.

00:15:26.506 --> 00:15:27.908
Be quiet!

00:15:28.509 --> 00:15:30.893
You must not allow such
trivial things to distract you.

00:15:31.022 --> 00:15:35.258
Due to the circumstances, our regular
praying won't be enough.

00:15:35.293 --> 00:15:38.217
So we'll double
our time for prayer today.

00:15:53.549 --> 00:15:55.081
My legs are killing me...

00:15:55.509 --> 00:15:56.304
Tell us more!

00:15:56.339 --> 00:15:58.249
Terry breaks all the rules
but he never gets in trouble!

00:15:58.473 --> 00:16:01.397
He rarely attends but his grades
are good!

00:16:02.721 --> 00:16:04.283
Terrius.

00:16:06.782 --> 00:16:10.499
That was close!
Let the sleeping dogs lie.

00:16:31.925 --> 00:16:33.070
Terrius.

00:16:33.596 --> 00:16:36.407
When I first saw you,
you were crying.

00:16:36.952 --> 00:16:39.899
But in the next moment,
you were laughing at my freckles.

00:16:43.349 --> 00:16:45.882
I have no idea which one is real you.

00:16:47.142 --> 00:16:48.320
Terry!

00:16:53.931 --> 00:16:55.285
Uh...

00:16:56.146 --> 00:17:00.472
Terry! Director wants to see you!

00:17:01.075 --> 00:17:02.791
Annoying old crone.

00:17:04.945 --> 00:17:07.315
Maybe he forgot me?

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:08.840
He's making fun of me!

00:17:09.052 --> 00:17:11.314
Oh no, the class is starting!

00:17:16.832 --> 00:17:20.569
Nobody is here.
In which classroom is today's lecture?

00:17:27.924 --> 00:17:29.128
To Candy.

00:17:29.129 --> 00:17:32.876
The next lecture is held at the northern
building, room 14.

00:17:33.641 --> 00:17:35.798
Somebody wrote me this note!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.648
-Uh, where is the northern building?
-That way.

00:17:46.649 --> 00:17:47.871
Thank you!

00:17:50.443 --> 00:17:52.348
Why does it have to be this far?

00:17:54.078 --> 00:17:55.649
There it is!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.100
Sorry I'm la...

00:18:25.397 --> 00:18:27.560
Eliza and the others got me again.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.020
What's up with this school?

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:48.865
That's it!

00:18:51.163 --> 00:18:54.289
Why did they say that this school
would've turned me into a prominent lady?

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:56.698
I'd only become an unpleasant, cold person!

00:18:57.079 --> 00:18:59.062
Orphan! Dogsbody!

00:18:59.188 --> 00:19:01.070
The academy's orders are final.

00:19:09.255 --> 00:19:11.833
The best school in England,
what a joke!

00:19:17.671 --> 00:19:18.851
Kurin!

00:19:20.272 --> 00:19:23.107
Where were you?
You had me worried!

00:19:24.913 --> 00:19:26.091
Kurin!

00:19:30.221 --> 00:19:31.431
Wait up!

00:19:32.149 --> 00:19:33.232
Kurin!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.057
Kurin, what are you trying to tell me?

00:19:37.248 --> 00:19:40.007
Kurin, please, don't leave me alone!

00:19:42.786 --> 00:19:44.120
Kurin, wait!

00:19:52.176 --> 00:19:53.726
Kurin!

00:19:58.646 --> 00:20:00.456
Kurin, you fool.

00:20:13.847 --> 00:20:15.917
It looks just like Pony's hill.

00:20:19.221 --> 00:20:20.420
Kurin!

00:20:22.921 --> 00:20:25.435
Alright, I'll try, too.

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:39.034
Kurin, so this is your home?

00:20:39.891 --> 00:20:42.327
I see you've prepared yourself a lot
of food.

00:20:43.961 --> 00:20:47.582
I see. So you've already arranged
your life in this place.

00:20:49.296 --> 00:20:52.369
Moreover, you've given me a place
where I can get rid of my sorrow.

00:20:52.746 --> 00:20:55.184
Kurin, I'm going to do my best, too.

00:20:55.219 --> 00:20:58.902
And someday, I'm going to show
you the place where I'm living now.

00:21:00.384 --> 00:21:04.020
I will come to this place
if I become lonely.

00:21:05.227 --> 00:21:10.545
Candy cried out to the now distant
sister Pony and sister Lane.

00:21:11.312 --> 00:21:19.950
Instead of answering, the image of their
smiling faces surfaced in Candy's heart.
